<# ================================================================
# File: .gitignore
# Location: repository root
# Author: Mark J. Latsha
# Co-Author: Microsoft Copilot
# Updated: 2026-06-07
# Description:
#   Consolidated ignore rules for the Starfield Intelligent Gallery
#   project. Removes merge conflict, combines Python + project rules,
#   and excludes backup/DO-NOT-USE folders.
# ================================================================

# -------------------------
# OS / Editor / IDE
# -------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# -------------------------
# Python
# -------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*.local
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# -------------------------
# Node / JS (if present)
# -------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log
package-lock.json

# -------------------------
# Build / Coverage / Test
# -------------------------
coverage/
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
.tox/
.nox/
pytest_cache/
coverage.xml
coverage.*
*.cover

# -------------------------
# Virtual DBs and local data
# -------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
photos.db

# Data folders (large - exclude unless intentionally tracked)
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/tmp/
exports/

# -------------------------
# Large media and generated assets
# -------------------------
*.ico
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.dds
*.tga
*.psd
*.xcf
thumbnails/
thumbs.db
cache/

# If you DO want specific assets tracked:
# !assets/logo/SIG_icon.ico

# -------------------------
# Application specific
# -------------------------
*.pyrcc
*.qrc
*.ui.py

# Logs and runtime files
logs/
*.log
*.pid
*.seed

# -------------------------
# Secrets and local config
# -------------------------
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
credentials.json
local_settings.py

# -------------------------
# Backup / DO NOT USE folders
# -------------------------
# Local backup of arcs — do not commit to GitHub
ui/Assets/arcs_backup_DO_NOT_USE/

# -------------------------
# Misc
# -------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
